事。在任十年，遇疾解职。卒于家，追赠骠骑将军。羡孙伯子，今御史中丞也。”","attribution":"《荀氏家传》《晋阳秋》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2c8f2bee76a8a33cc38","start":0,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
